{
  "$defs": {
    "PromptBlock": {
      "description": "快照里一段内容的语义块。由**编译器在装配时标注**，不是事后猜的。\n\n``key`` 是闭集：新车道没写进映射表时落到 ``other``，不会静默算进别的组。",
      "enum": [
        "system",
        "persona",
        "memory",
        "plan",
        "media",
        "summary",
        "history",
        "input",
        "other"
      ],
      "title": "PromptBlock",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "PromptSnapshotItem": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "快照里的一条消息。``index`` 是它在**真实 messages 数组**里的下标。\n\n截断后下标会跳号——这是**故意的**：跳号说明中间被丢掉了，\n而不是\"她当时只看到这些\"。",
      "properties": {
        "at": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "At"
        },
        "content": {
          "title": "Content",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "index": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Index",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "lane": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Lane"
        },
        "role": {
          "title": "Role",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "schema_version": {
          "const": "v1",
          "default": "v1",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "sender": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Sender"
        },
        "tokens": {
          "default": 0,
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Tokens",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "truncated": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Truncated",
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "index",
        "role",
        "content"
      ],
      "title": "PromptSnapshotItem",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "PromptSnapshotModel": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "这一轮**实际解析到**的模型（与 `resolve_profile` 同一份结论）。",
      "properties": {
        "config_revision": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Config Revision"
        },
        "model_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Model Id"
        },
        "profile": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Profile"
        },
        "provider_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Provider Id"
        },
        "schema_version": {
          "const": "v1",
          "default": "v1",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Source"
        }
      },
      "title": "PromptSnapshotModel",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "PromptSnapshotSection": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个语义块的展示分组。``label`` 直接给前端显示，**不要在前端再翻译**。",
      "properties": {
        "collapsed": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Collapsed",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "items": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/PromptSnapshotItem"
          },
          "title": "Items",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "key": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PromptBlock"
        },
        "label": {
          "title": "Label",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "role": {
          "title": "Role",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "schema_version": {
          "const": "v1",
          "default": "v1",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "tokens": {
          "default": 0,
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Tokens",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "key",
        "label",
        "role"
      ],
      "title": "PromptSnapshotSection",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "PromptSnapshotState": {
      "description": "「查看本次提示词」的三种状态。**必须互相区分**。\n\n- ``available``：这一轮的快照还在保留期内，`sections` 是真正发出去的内容；\n- ``expired``：**曾经有过**快照，但已过保留期或正文已被清理任务清空。\n  元数据（`created_at` / `expires_at` / `model` / `token_total`）仍在，\n  `sections` 为空——内容确实没了，不是没存过；\n- ``unavailable``：**从来没存下来**（捕获失败，或这条消息早于本功能）。\n\n三者混成一种的话，用户看到\"打不开\"时分不清该重试、该关掉功能、还是\n本来就该没有——而\"沉默/失败都要能被解释\"是这个项目的基本要求。",
      "enum": [
        "available",
        "expired",
        "unavailable"
      ],
      "title": "PromptSnapshotState",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://ling.local/contracts/v1/PromptSnapshotOut.schema.json",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "`GET /v1/messages/{message_id}/prompt` 的响应。\n\n``token_total`` 是**这一轮实际发出去**的估算总量；截断时它仍包含没存进\n`sections` 的部分，所以**不必等于** `sum(section.tokens)`。",
  "properties": {
    "created_at": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Created At"
    },
    "dropped_items": {
      "default": 0,
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Dropped Items",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "expires_at": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Expires At"
    },
    "message_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Message Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "model": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PromptSnapshotModel"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null
    },
    "note": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Note"
    },
    "schema_version": {
      "const": "v1",
      "default": "v1",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "sections": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/PromptSnapshotSection"
      },
      "title": "Sections",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "state": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/PromptSnapshotState"
    },
    "token_total": {
      "default": 0,
      "description": "这一轮实际发出去的 token 估算总量（含因超限未存进 sections 的部分）",
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Token Total",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "truncated": {
      "default": false,
      "title": "Truncated",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "turn_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Turn Id"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "state",
    "message_id"
  ],
  "title": "PromptSnapshotOut",
  "type": "object",
  "x-ling-schema-version": "v1"
}
